eligibility.criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* 18 years of age or older (no upper limit);
* ability to read, write, and speak English and/or Spanish;
* ability to provide informed consent;
* less than 30-days since GLP-1 RA cessation;
* willing to participate.

Exclusion Criteria:

* No clinically significant weight loss (e.g., \< 5% body weight) while taking GLP medication;
* major psychiatric illness, cognitive impairment, or substance misuse that could impair ability to participate;
* medical conditions that significantly affect weight or make participation unsafe (e.g., pregnancy or breastfeeding, recent bariatric surgery, current use of GLP 1 or other anti-obesity medications, or endocrine disorders that alter weight regulation);
* inability to use a smartphone or complete remote study procedures;
* participation in another weight loss or maintenance program or clinical trial judged by investigators to interfere with study involvement;
* Adults unable to consent (cognitively impaired);
* Wards of the state;
* Anyone under age 18.
